{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0f3cf7647610c2ce","name":"Cave-In","source":{"id":"source:reference-0f3cf7647610c2ce","title":"Cave-In","revision":21287,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:30:29Z","sha256":"254fa3d268530c2c359869c97929faec4dded1b597ec48352f9d46b5d1573497","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21287","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cave-In&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0f3cf7647610c2ce","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The cave quakes violently, causing heavy stones to crash down to the dusty floor."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In tight underground quarters, a Cave-In can be especially dangerous. The Hazard might be triggered during a subterranean battle, or it could occur at an appropriate moment in a story arc. For example, the ceiling might come down as the heroes are about to reach their final destination, delaying their progress.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Cave-In Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A loud noise occurs within the area of the Hazard; targeting every being and object in the area.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +10 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the being escapes the Cave-In.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," (DC 28):"]}," The character tumbles away from the debris, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 23):"]}," The character realizes that the rock ceiling might be weak enough to collapse if a loud sound occurs within the cavern."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
